/*
Displays active media info and inline playback controls in the top bar.
- Streamlined and stable single-row ticker layout.
- Smoothly scrolls long track titles.
- Integrated buttons for Previous, Play/Pause, Next, and Mute directly on the bar.
*/
// ==/WindhawkModReadme==

// ==WindhawkModSettings==
/*
- font_size: 13
  $name: Font Size
- text_color: "FFFFFF"
  $name: Text Color (HEX)
- x_position: -550
  $name: Horizontal Screen Center Offset (negative = left of center, positive = right of center)
- y_offset: 8
  $name: Distance From Top (Y)
*/
// ==/WindhawkModSettings==

